{"unit_id":"huermi__dsh-deepseek-web-adapter#feature-1","repo":"huermi/dsh-deepseek-web-adapter","commit":"43b4c17e7e5ee18737fc84feeed6f8c01666cedf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-web-adapter 的功能「自动启动本地网关」：DSH 加载插件时 host 拉起网关，卸载时结束由它启动的进程；网关监听本机端口并提供 OpenAI 兼容模型接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-45","lib/index.js:51-105","resources/dsweb-gateway.js:480-485"]}
